---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { formatDate, guideHref, withBase } from '../lib/paths';
import { jobClasses } from '../data/job-classes';

const allGuides = (await getCollection('guides')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
const sourceGuides = allGuides.filter(guide => guide.data.sources.length > 0);
const classPages = jobClasses.filter(job => job.id !== 'orphan');
---
<Shell title="Sources & credits" description="Source links, authors, acknowledgements, and project credits for Return to Morroc: Refuge Fieldnotes." currentId="about">
  <div class="about-page">
    <span class="eyebrow">SOURCES & ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS</span>
    <h1>Good knowledge deserves<br />a clear trail home.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Return to Morroc: Refuge Fieldnotes is an independent personal guide library. It brings publicly available guide material into a common reading format. It is not the server's official website.</p>
      <p>Source links, authors, and acknowledgements for every guide are collected here. Each source entry is grouped with the guide that uses it.</p>

      <section class="related-section" aria-labelledby="keep-exploring-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow" id="keep-exploring-heading">KEEP EXPLORING</span>
        <div class="related-grid">
          {sourceGuides.map(guide => <a href={guideHref(guide.id)}><Icon name={guide.data.icon} size={22} /><div><small>{guide.data.category}</small><strong>{guide.data.title}</strong></div><Icon name="arrow" size={19} /></a>)}
        </div>
      </section>

      <h2 id="guide-sources">Sources & acknowledgements</h2>
      {sourceGuides.map(guide => <section class="source-guide-entry" aria-labelledby={`source-guide-${guide.id}`}>
        <h3 id={`source-guide-${guide.id}`}><a href={guideHref(guide.id)}>{guide.data.title}</a></h3>
        <p class="source-guide-date">Editorial update: {formatDate(guide.data.updated)} · In-game verification: {guide.data.verified ? formatDate(guide.data.verified) : 'not recorded'}</p>
        <p>{guide.data.statusNote}</p>
        <ol class="source-list">{guide.data.sources.map(source => <li><div><a href={source.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{source.title}<Icon name="external" size={13} /></a><span>By {source.author}</span></div><p>{source.note}</p><small>Original update: {source.sourceUpdated ?? 'Not specified'}</small></li>)}</ol>
      </section>)}

      <section class="source-guide-entry" aria-labelledby="class-guide-sources">
        <h3 id="class-guide-sources">Class guides</h3>
        <p class="source-guide-date">Class pages were reviewed against Refuge class references on October 17, 2026. Source update dates were not specified.</p>
        <p>Trickster editorial update: October 20, 2026. Owner confirms Serin can switch between the Reaper reward and Revenant Ebel Card after the Revenant job change. Night Boots and Samurai Mask recommendations confirmed by the site owner; item levels, slots, and Samurai Mask’s Critical Rate bonus checked against the <a href="https://rtm-database.pages.dev/">Refuge item database</a>. Source update date unknown.</p>
        <p>Revenant editorial update: October 20, 2026. Owner photos illustrate the Niflheim quest start and Reaper reward; the owner confirms Serin’s reward exchange. Published with owner approval; source-reviewed against Refuge and Phawkes’ StatsSkills Guide, Gears Guide, and How to Combo tabs. Source update dates and spreadsheet reuse terms are unspecified; no in-game verification is recorded. Phawkes credits Sparda, Arumakan, Kim, Kharon, and knoxzera for suggestions, and Trueduck for the gear template. The owner supplied the spreadsheet for integration.</p>
        <p>Vagabond and Legend editorial update: October 22, 2026. Vagabond’s job change, combat skills, and owner-directed dagger progression were checked against the Refuge class pages and current item data. The Gear page confirms dagger HP Drain and Splash Radius random options. Legend is published with owner approval on October 22, 2026. Source update dates unknown and in-game verification not recorded. The pages preserve original-server class descriptions alongside Refuge changes. Refuge permits copying site content.</p>
        <p>Legend’s selected leveling equipment and cards were reviewed against Gate’s Patch 1.2 gear guide (original update: June 16, 2024) and current Refuge item records on October 22, 2026. The owner’s weapon and manual choices are retained. Older Shadow-set advice is replaced with current Class Gem options; farming setups are excluded. The source’s general reuse terms are unspecified; this guide uses factual reference material with original concise wording. Whole-guide in-game verification remains unrecorded.</p>
        <p>Prowler’s “Good consistent damage” strength is an owner correction reviewed October 18, 2026, replacing the older class reference’s burst-damage description.</p>
        <ol class="source-list">
          {classPages.map(job => <li><div><a href={withBase(`classes/${job.id}/`)}>{job.name} guide</a><a href={`https://rtmrefuge.pages.dev/classes/${job.id}.html`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Refuge — {job.name}<Icon name="external" size={13} /></a></div><span>By Return to Morroc: Refuge team</span></li>)}
          <li><div><a href="https://rtmrefuge.pages.dev/classes.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Refuge — Class tree<Icon name="external" size={13} /></a></div><span>By Return to Morroc: Refuge team</span><p>Class progression, role tags, sprites, and artwork.</p><small>Original update: Not specified</small></li>
          <li><div><a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Z_9RXyn390tUyyvndG04YOMMVHmy3f0kksOx5mH3is0/edit?gid=109244848#gid=109244848" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Phawkes — Trickster and Revenant reference<Icon name="external" size={13} /></a><span>Skill and stat suggestions credited to Sparda, Arumakan, Kim, Kharon, and knoxzera.</span></div><p>Stat allocation, skill trees, equipment suggestions, and Revenant combos.</p><small>Original update: Not specified</small></li>
          <li><div><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/18bu-vAhLQTOpVGCDqq6CUnljuUHQ-oeX6A4mo7o0dj8/edit" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Gate — Legend gear guide, Patch 1.2<Icon name="external" size={13} /></a><span>By Gate</span></div><p>Selected leveling equipment and cards, cross-checked against current Refuge records.</p><small>Original update: June 16, 2024</small></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <h2>Dates and verification</h2>
      <p>An editorial update records a change to a guide. Source update dates are shown separately when available. In-game verification dates appear only when recorded.</p>

      <h2>Artwork, type, and interface credits</h2>
      <p>The scenic illustrations and class portraits are sourced from the <a href="https://rtmrefuge.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Refuge website</a>, which states its site content is free to copy. Third-party artwork remains the property of its respective owners. The New Player Guide includes eight original document images, with source attribution recorded above.</p>
      <p>Amarante and Atkinson Hyperlegible are distributed under the SIL Open Font License. Their license files are included alongside the local fonts. The Refuge mark is a local copy of the <a href="https://rtm-database.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">database website's header image</a>; the Fieldnotes wordmark and interface are created for this library.</p>
      <p>The Weaver of Dreams uses the animated Baroness of Blood sprite (ID 2661) from the <a href="https://rtm-database.pages.dev/mvp-timer" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Refuge database</a>, identified by the site owner.</p>
      <p>Orphan skill icons come from the <a href="https://rtm-database.pages.dev/skills.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Refuge database</a>. Orphanage NPC sprites were matched against owner-provided screenshots using <a href="https://rune-nifelheim.com/npc/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Rune Nifelheim</a> and <a href="https://ratemyragnarok.com/npcs/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Rate My Ragnarok</a>, and rendered with <a href="https://github.com/adsonpleal/ragassets" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">RagAssets</a>. Ragnarok Online artwork belongs to Gravity and its respective creators.</p>
    </div>
    <Footer />
  </div>
</Shell>
